Changes made to Paseo in Neox include:

- The desktop app (packages/desktop) loads the Synara-derived interface in
  packages/desktop-web through a local bridge to the Paseo daemon, and is
  renamed Neox, with its own application identifier, icons and release feed
  (https://github.com/istoo/neox/releases).
- The daemon (packages/server) adds a local model gateway with provider
  routing, failover, allowances and sensitive-data masking, plus the
  workspace, agent and settings APIs the desktop interface uses.
- The website and hosted services of Paseo are not part of this repository.

